sequenceDiagram
    participant Receptionist
    participant Web as Web app
    participant API
    participant Pay as PaymentsService
    participant Com as CommissionService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Note over API,DB: At visit completion each visit charge got a snapshot - doctor assignment, plan, rate or fixed amount
    Receptionist->>Web: Open Collect payment and pick charges
    Web->>API: POST /payments/preview
    API->>Com: previewForAllocations
    Com-->>API: Doctor share per doctor - only with earnings.all.view and billing.commissions on
    API-->>Web: Preview with or without the Doctor share line
    Receptionist->>Web: Confirm the payment
    Web->>API: POST /payments
    API->>Pay: runCollect in one transaction
    Pay->>DB: Insert payment and allocations, recompute totals
    Pay->>Com: recordForCharges, source ALLOCATION
    Com->>DB: Read net, tax, allocated and already recorded per charge
    Com->>Com: target = rate on pre-tax collected, capped at net
    Com->>DB: Insert one entry per charge = target minus already recorded
    API-->>Web: Payment saved, receipt shown
